Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOANlNG AND PANTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.14,0:00:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[GROANlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.33,0:01:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[TRACTOR BEEPlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:01:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT: You are a lifesaver.\NJESSE: Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.51,0:01:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can't\Nthank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, hey, mad--\NMad props.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,l could have sworn\Nthe guy said south.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But then all of a sudden\Nwe're off the main road
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.15,0:02:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,then l'm trying to read the map\Nwhile l'm driving,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.15,0:02:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,which is a bonehead maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And then all of a sudden, bam,\Nwe're-- We're in that ditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.61,0:02:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bam. l'm like,\N"What the hell?"\NYou know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Oh, yes,\Nand my coffee mug.\NOf coffee? My mug of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,lt spills all over my pants,\Nl mean-- Just a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's your Sony GPS,\Nl mean, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.04,0:02:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH CHUCKLE]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just. ..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Like l said,\Nwe couldn't be more grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.38,0:03:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just\Ndump them here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What,\Nand somebody finds them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,People have seen us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[ENGlNE SPUTTERlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're--\NYou're gonna\Nflood it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm not gonna flood it.\NShe's not going to flood,\Nall right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just gonna stay positive,\Nright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna clean up\Nthis mess. And you, start.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it. See, you flooded it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. You know what?\NThe RV is going to start now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The RV is going to start\Nright now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's gonna start and\Nwe're gonna drive it\Nover to your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My house?\NYes. Your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna drive it over there\Nand park it overnight.\NAnd then tomorrow--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh, man, not my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.27,0:04:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,After we finish\Ncleaning up this mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we will go our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Our paths will never cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And we will tell this to no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what, l can talk now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. That goes double for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Be good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[ENGlNE SPUTTERlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[ENGlNE REVS]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,BOTH:\NYes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.31,0:04:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH YELL]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[RUSTLlNG AND CAN CLATTERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.49,0:04:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN GROANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN WHEEZlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.31,0:05:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[KNOCKlNG ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NWalt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You coming out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NMm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN [ON TV]:\NWe got looky-loos\Nin both directions, Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Better plan on being late if\Nyou're going in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.39,0:06:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Lisa in the Skycopter,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll have more Albuquerque\Ntraffic on the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, um, you wanna hear\Nsomething funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a--\NA faculty meeting\Nlast Thursday
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.23,0:06:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and the topic was\Nsenior-class photos
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.32,0:06:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and how we had instituted\Na new rule last year
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.87,0:06:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,that seniors are allowed\Nto have photos taken
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,by a photographer\Nof their choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, not necessarily\Nthe photographer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that the school hires, right?\NSo--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RlNGlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,--um, eh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,so anyway, uh,\Nsome of the senior girls
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,were going to that, um,\NGlamour Shots place
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,to have their photos taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And now they're bringing us\Nall these photos,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and Joan Everman--\NYou know Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,--suddenly has to go through\Nall these photos
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and turn them down\Nbecause they show cleavage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get enough\Npancakes, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. l-- l'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NYou know,\Neven the small-busted girls
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,have cleavage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently there's some new type
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,of brassiere or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RlNGlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wonderbra.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.05,0:07:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's the Wonderbra.\NYeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE CONTlNUES RlNGlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANSWERlNG MACHlNE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER [ON RECORDlNG]:\NHey, there.\NYou've reached Walt,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler and Walter Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't come to the phone\Nright now, so please\Nleave us a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[MACHlNE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE [OVER MACHlNE]:\NHello, Mr. White.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is AT&T calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you happy with your current\Nlong-distance service?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if you're not, l would\Ndefinitely really, really love
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.49,0:07:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,to talk to you\Nas soon as possible about--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Hello? Hello,\Nthis is Walter White\Nspeaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You said he was\Npractically dead, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You said he would die\Nany minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, uh,\Nl am having breakfast
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,with my family right now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and l-- l really don't\Nappreciate these sales calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, too bad, man,\Nbecause guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,l went and put my ear\Nto the RV.\Nl can hear him, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,rolling around in there,\Nall right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,l-- l-- l think he's awake, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,l think he's trying\Nto get loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.10,0:08:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you?\Nl'm freaking out over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT [WHlSPERlNG]:\NCalm down, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna help me\Nclean this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? We got loose ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,l will be there after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, after school.\NAre you shitting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ditch it, man. Call in sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[lN USUAL TONE]\NListen, uh, that is just\Nnot gonna work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm-- l'm not interested\Nin that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And, uh, l would appreciate it\Nif you don't call here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.\NThey're so annoying,\Nthose people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a good day, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mom. You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.\NBye, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:08:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive safe.\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[DlALlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.57,0:09:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RlNGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE [OVER MACHlNE]:\NYo, yo, yo,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.07,0:09:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,1 , 4, 8, 3 to the 3\Nto the 6 to the 9,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,representing the ABQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.49,0:09:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What up, beyotch?\NLeave it at the tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANSWERlNG MACHlNE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So the term "chiral"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,derives from the Greek word\N"hand."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.69,0:09:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the concept here\Nbeing that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,just as your left hand\Nand your right hand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.03,0:09:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,\N\Nare mirror images\Nof one another, right,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,identical and yet opposite,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,well, so, too,\Norganic compounds can exist
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:10:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,as mirror-image forms\Nof one another
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.50,0:10:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,all the way down\Nat the molecular level.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But although they may\Nlook the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,they don't always\Nbehave the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.05,0:10:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For instance...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, l'm sorry.\NUh, for instance, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thalidomide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The-- The right-handed isomer\Nof the drug thalidomide
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,is a perfectly fine,\Ngood medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,to give to a pregnant woman\Nto prevent morning sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But make the mistake of giving\Nthat same pregnant woman
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,the left-handed isomer\Nof the drug thalidomide
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and her child will be born\Nwith horrible birth defects.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is precisely\Nwhat happened in the 1 950s.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So chiral, chirality,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,mirrored images, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Active, inactive, good, bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,ls this gonna be\Non the murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.45,0:11:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,ls this gonna be\Non the midterm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, chirality on the midterm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[SCHOOL BELL RlNGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. Well, maybe.\NMaybe. Yes, you know--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But prepare for it\Nto be on the midterm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't hurt to know it, right?\NSo--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowledge is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR CREAKS THEN SLAMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Oh, no, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:13:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good.\NNot good, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLYDE McPHATTER'S\N"YOU'RE MOVlN' ME"\NPLAYlNG OVER SPEAKERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[TlRES SCREECH]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.49,0:13:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What the--?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.37,0:13:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHEEZlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.51,0:13:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey. Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.89,0:13:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.85,0:13:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[TRUMP'S "KEEP BALLlN"'\NPLAYlNG ON COMPUTER]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.21,0:14:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,MlLFs?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell is a MlLF?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[KRAZY-8 WHEEZlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[SNORlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[KRAZY-8 COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock the other one\Nout in the RV.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's, uh:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.12,0:15:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure?\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're positive?\NHey, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.16,0:15:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to go\Ncheck it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, yeah, Good idea.\NMaybe l should do that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,before he, too, wanders off\Ndown the damn street.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you know what?\Nl am sick--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just-- All right.\NAll right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Just--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The one downstairs,\Ntell me about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. Anything.\NSomething.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Start with his name,\Nat least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Krazy-8.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Krazy-8. What the hell\Ndoes that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know, man, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:15:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,lt means, like-- Like,\NKrazy-8, okay? l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.31,0:16:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So you work with him regularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,His cousin, mainly.\NWho's his cousin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.49,0:16:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The-- The guy out in the RV.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right,\Nall right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Krazy-8's one level higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.33,0:16:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,One level higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know.\NNot, like, street level. Higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how there's, like,\Na Starbucks on every corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.84,0:16:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Krazy-8 is like the dude\Nthat sells Starbucks' beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so he's a distributor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so is he. . .?\Nl mean, is. . .?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,ln other words, what is his\Nreputation for violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.35,0:16:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um, he did try
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,to kill us both yesterday,\Nso there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, what l'm trying to say
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,is that he's a distributor,\Nright?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a-- He's a businessman.\NHe's a man of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,lt would therefore\Nseem to follow that he is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.37,0:16:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,capable of acting out of\Nmutual self-interest, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:17:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he is capable\Nof listening to reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, what--? What kind\Nof reason? You mean, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"Dear Krazy-8, hey, listen,\Nif l let you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you promise not to come back\Nand waste my entire family?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No Colombian neckties?"\NYou mean that kind of reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, man, l can't say as l have\Nhigh fucking hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,where that's concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[THUMP]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.82,0:17:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHlSPERlNG]\NWhat was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What was what?\NShh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[CREAKlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't tie him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell\Ndidn't we tie him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.83,0:17:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he was out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what--\NWhat if he's faking it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, like,\Nif it was me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,l'd be all faking\Nbeing knocked out, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And then,\Nwhen the coast is clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,l'd be up looking\Nfor weapons and shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to pounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[KRAZY-8 GROANlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.31,0:18:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh, shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHEEZlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.95,0:18:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, see. Now, if it was me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and l couldn't find\Na decent enough weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,l would just lie back down\Nand bide my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So now what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep asking me that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,like you think l have\Nsome answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you gotta\Ndo something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We have got to do something,\Nand l am open to suggestions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, uh, okay,\Nthis whole thing was your deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare put that on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought those guys\Nout there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.87,0:19:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, like l came to you,\Nbegging to cook meth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"Oh, hey, nerdiest old dude\Nl know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you wanna come cook crystal?"\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:19:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,l'd ask my diaper-wearing granny
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.39,0:19:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but her wheelchair\Nwouldn't fit in the RV.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the, uh--\NThe-- The-- The phosphate gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.65,0:20:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The phosphine gas.\NWhat about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, do-- l mean, do you think\Nit still might kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, with, like,\Na delayed reaction or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,l-- l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed\Nto be a scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this isn't even\Nthe issue
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,that demands\Nimmediate attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have got a body in that RV.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.13,0:20:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's getting warmer outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And we have got to\Ndo something about that soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.34,0:20:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And in a way that\Nno one will ever find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, that-- That last part\Nis very, very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, it seems to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.10,0:20:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that our best course of action
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.15,0:20:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,would be chemical\Ndisincorporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.86,0:21:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Dissolving in strong acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.33,0:21:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, ahem,\Nyou're not serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.97,0:21:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.47,0:21:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, who's gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.60,0:21:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.98,0:21:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,l guess we'll both do it\Ntogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mr. White, okay, l'm not--\Nl'm not good with dead bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we are in this\Nfifty-fifty. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,l guess the only other fair way\Nto go about this would be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,that one of us deals with\Nthe body situation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:22:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,while the other one of us deals\Nwith the Krazy-8 situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,ln a scenario like this,\Nl don't suppose it is bad form
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.19,0:22:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,to just flip a coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Heads or tails?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.37,0:22:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, l'll-- l'll do the body\Nin the acid, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.20,0:22:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Heads or tails?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.13,0:22:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Heads. Heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.57,0:23:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Best two out of three?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.62,0:23:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RlNGlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.01,0:23:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE [ON RECORDlNG]:\NYo, yo, yo, 1 , 4, 8, 3 to the 3
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.22,0:23:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,to the 6 to the 9,\Nrepresenting the ABQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.09,0:23:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What up, beyotch?\NLeave it at the tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.60,0:23:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANSWERlNG MACHlNE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.60,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NHey, Mr. White, it's me.\NPick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.60,0:23:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a container question.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.31,0:23:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. White.\NPick up the phone, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.53,0:23:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.\NYo, what kind of plastic, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.03,0:23:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[OVER PHONE]\NPolyethylene.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.74,0:23:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how the hell am l\Nsupposed to know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because l told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.45,0:23:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.75,0:23:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.95,0:23:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,look at the bottom\Nfor a triangle
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.25,0:24:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,stamped LDPE.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.67,0:24:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,lt should be molded\Nright into the plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.88,0:24:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, LDPE.\NRight on, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.63,0:24:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know, man.\NThis feels kind of flimsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.14,0:24:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Any decent acid's\Ngonna eat right through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not hydrofluoric.\NWhy not?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you skipped,\Nclowned around
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.98,0:24:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,or otherwise jerked off through\Nevery lecture l ever gave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.90,0:24:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as l'm concerned,\Nyour chemistry education is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.28,0:24:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay, be a dick about it.\NJesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.54,0:24:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So, hey, have you, um...?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.79,0:24:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you done the--?\NThe thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.05,0:24:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l'm--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.01,0:24:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm working up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.18,0:24:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHlSPERlNG]\NYou know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.51,0:24:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,l bet he doesn't even wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.72,0:24:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, not even\Nif you took him\Nto the hospital right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.98,0:25:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if it was me,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.23,0:25:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,l would just try and think of it\Nlike l was--
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.86,0:25:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,l was doing him a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.47,0:25:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN [OVER PA]:\Nl need a check approval\Non checkstand eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.64,0:25:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Approval on checkstand eight,\Nplease. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.99,0:25:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.49,0:25:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.71,0:26:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.97,0:26:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.58,0:27:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,KRAZY-8:\NWho's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.33,0:27:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you fucking break in?\NShow me who's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.34,0:27:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. l see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.93,0:27:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.89,0:27:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.06,0:27:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey--!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.27,0:27:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.65,0:27:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.98,0:27:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,l need water.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.19,0:27:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.07,0:27:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.28,0:27:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me some water,\Nwould you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.37,0:28:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.87,0:28:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.03,0:29:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like the crust?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.67,0:29:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my cousin Emilio?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.17,0:29:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.65,0:29:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR SLAMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.81,0:29:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[KRAZY-8 COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.74,0:30:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, l'm a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.21,0:30:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.61,0:30:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.38,0:31:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.45,0:31:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.75,0:31:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NHey, Mr. White.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.17,0:31:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. White?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.42,0:31:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.80,0:31:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.26,0:31:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you smoking weed?\NOh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.39,0:31:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, is that--?\Nls that my weed?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.68,0:31:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.81,0:31:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Make yourself at home,\Nwhy don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.48,0:32:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what'd you end up buying?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.78,0:32:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.78,0:32:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No store in town sells a plastic\Nbin big enough for a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.20,0:32:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't suppose\Nyou could buy two bins?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.91,0:32:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And, uh, just:
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.17,0:32:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Legs in one,\Ntorso in the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.80,0:32:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.05,0:32:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't suppose\Nyou could kiss my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.31,0:32:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.44,0:32:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.65,0:32:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,how'd it--? How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.15,0:32:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[KRAZY-8 COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.86,0:32:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.66,0:32:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not-- Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.45,0:32:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.54,0:33:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn. l gotta go.\NHey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.17,0:33:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No, no, no.\NCome back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.92,0:33:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. l'll do it tomorrow,\Nl promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.96,0:33:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.17,0:33:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,l've got a doctor's appointment.\Nl gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.51,0:33:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, stay away from him.\NHe's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.51,0:33:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.77,0:33:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, we flipped a coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.52,0:33:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.94,0:33:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[KRAZY-8 COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.44,0:33:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We flipped a coin!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.86,0:33:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're-- We're good?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.45,0:33:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're very good.\NWe're excellent, l'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.54,0:33:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.08,0:33:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, would you look\Nat that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.71,0:33:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[ALL CHUCKLE]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.88,0:33:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile, peanut.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.13,0:33:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So who's up for knowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.43,0:33:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...\NUh. ..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.64,0:33:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH LAUGH]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.22,0:33:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's-- lt's...\NUh. ..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.56,0:33:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.77,0:33:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.06,0:34:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.81,0:34:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?\NOB-GYN: Pretty sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.90,0:34:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH LAUGH]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.23,0:34:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.90,0:34:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. Can l tell you,\Nthat's exactly what l was hoping.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.03,0:34:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.86,0:34:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember you said that\Nwhen she's 1 6 and starts dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.99,0:34:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[SKYLER LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.20,0:34:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,OB-GYN:\NLooking fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.04,0:34:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see if they're done\Nwith the blood sugar,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.08,0:34:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,then we'll get you out of here.\Nl'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.44,0:34:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Jesse Pinkman?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.45,0:35:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse...?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.62,0:35:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse Pinkman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.83,0:35:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He-- He called\Njust this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.84,0:35:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, please don't deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.05,0:35:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.51,0:35:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,lt-- lt says on his MyShout page\Nhe attended Wynne.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.64,0:35:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What, was he one\Nof your students?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.47,0:35:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.68,0:35:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He was nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.56,0:35:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who--? Who is he to you?\NWhy--? Why is he calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.98,0:35:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this big secret
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.36,0:35:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you seem to be discussing\Nwith some druggie burnout?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.53,0:35:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't come home last night\Nuntil 2 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.62,0:35:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't tell me\Nwhere you've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.16,0:35:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You spent the entire night\Nin the bathroom, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.29,0:35:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what's going on\Nwith you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.84,0:35:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think\Nyou owe me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.55,0:35:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this Jesse Pinkman\Nto you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.10,0:36:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He sells me pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.10,0:36:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He sells you pot?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.15,0:36:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Marijuana, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.19,0:36:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a lot.\Nl mean, l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.45,0:36:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.11,0:36:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,l kind of like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.62,0:36:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.75,0:36:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What--? What are you, like,\N1 6 years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.71,0:36:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother-in-law\Nis a DEA agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.38,0:36:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What--?\NWhat is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.04,0:36:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Skyler,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.22,0:36:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.59,0:36:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,l just haven't\Nquite been myself lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.93,0:36:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. No shit.\NThanks for noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.93,0:36:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,l haven't been myself lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.35,0:36:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but l love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.48,0:36:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing about that\Nhas changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.07,0:36:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing ever will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.44,0:36:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So right now, what l need
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.78,0:37:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,is for you to climb down\Nout of my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.04,0:37:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.33,0:37:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you do that for me, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.29,0:37:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you please, just once,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.13,0:37:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,get off my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.80,0:37:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.84,0:37:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,l'd appreciate it.\Nl really would.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.41,0:37:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.80,0:37:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop in-- ln 1 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.72,0:38:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.94,0:38:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.98,0:38:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[SNORTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.37,0:38:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,SHEMP [OVER TV]:\NYour face is too sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.00,0:38:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,MOE [OVER TV]:\NPowder. Powder!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.46,0:38:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,SHEMP:\NTake a powder, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.34,0:38:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[KRAZY-8 COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.51,0:38:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,MOE:\NNice. Beautiful talcum powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.59,0:38:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky you, number eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.93,0:38:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[SNEEZES]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.85,0:38:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just meat, it's all just--\NJust a bunch of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.32,0:38:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[FLlES BUZZlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.53,0:39:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.86,0:39:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[GROANlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.74,0:39:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're cool,\Nyou're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.62,0:39:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all good, you're all--\NYou're all good. You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.16,0:39:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's fine.\Nlt's just a bunch of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.42,0:39:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.18,0:39:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[PANTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.23,0:39:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.11,0:39:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. You. Yes, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.24,0:39:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,May l talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.08,0:39:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa,\Nhey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.66,0:39:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is private property.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.91,0:39:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a minute.\Nl-- l wanna talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.75,0:39:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, not interested. Come on.\NSKYLER: Hey, don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.42,0:40:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.17,0:40:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, look,\Nnot touching, okay?\NNot touching here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.76,0:40:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, lady,\Nwhatever you're selling,\Nl ain't buying, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.59,0:40:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my name\Nis Skyler White, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.51,0:40:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband\Nis Walter White, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.35,0:40:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.56,0:40:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.27,0:40:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.02,0:40:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.56,0:40:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.48,0:40:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,my brother-in-law\Nis a DEA agent
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.11,0:40:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and l will not hesitate\Nto call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.61,0:40:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if l have to.\NUnderstood?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.78,0:40:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your one\Nand only warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.37,0:40:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not sell marijuana\Nto my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.59,0:40:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.\Nl mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.59,0:40:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call our house again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.80,0:40:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay away from him, or\Nyou will be one sorry individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.43,0:40:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.64,0:40:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,l-- l , uh, think so, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.56,0:40:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, no more marijuana.\NMm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.14,0:40:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,l can-- l can dig it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.94,0:41:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can dig it. Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.83,0:41:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it's any\Nof my business,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.33,0:41:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but you might wanna consider\Na different line of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.50,0:41:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.23,0:41:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.44,0:41:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTlNG AND PANTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.56,0:42:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.52,0:42:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to your house,\Nyou know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.39,0:42:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes perfect sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.27,0:42:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.48,0:42:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.69,0:42:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,let's completely screw up\Nyour house
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.77,0:42:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so you never wanna spend\Nanother night in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.07,0:42:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. You know, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.70,0:42:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.41,0:42:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and how's about l send\Nover my psycho-bitch wife
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.08,0:42:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to, uh, you know, break your\Nballs and threaten you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.92,0:42:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,God, that would be hilarious,\Nyou know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.17,0:42:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, you know,\Nthe killer in the basement,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.67,0:42:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the one who's completely\Nmy responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.97,0:42:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,hell, let's just\Nlet him live down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.43,0:42:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just, l don't know, make sure\Nto feed him, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.89,0:43:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,three times a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.81,0:43:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not?\Nlt's been really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.69,0:43:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much\Nfor the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.36,0:43:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,l always dreamt about,\Nl don't know, melting bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.28,0:43:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[JESSE WHlMPERS\NTHEN COUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.08,0:43:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[GROANlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.80,0:43:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.92,0:43:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.30,0:43:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a brother\Nin the goddamn DEA?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.52,0:43:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.72,0:43:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you were just doing\Nsome ride-along.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.64,0:43:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes or no, do you have a brother\Nin the DEA?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.90,0:43:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a brother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.11,0:43:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, there's a load\Noff my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.11,0:43:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.49,0:43:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your freaking wife told me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.32,0:43:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,when she was here\Nall up in my shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.57,0:43:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.12,0:44:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She almost caught me\Nmoving Emilio.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.66,0:44:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job on wearing\Nthe pants in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.96,0:44:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And why'd you go and tell her\Nl was selling you weed?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.67,0:44:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Because somehow\Nit seemed preferable
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.26,0:44:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to admitting that l cook\Ncrystal meth and killed a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.56,0:44:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[SNlFFlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.35,0:44:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,ls that what l think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.85,0:44:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah, it is.\Nl smoked a bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.40,0:44:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?\NMy house, my rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.77,0:44:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no, no.\NHey, don't give me that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.19,0:44:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,l held up my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.78,0:44:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,l already took care\Nof Emilio.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.40,0:44:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still diddling around\Ntrying to get your nut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.78,0:44:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, boo-hoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.70,0:44:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,l have the truly awful job here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.66,0:44:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you wanna-- You wanna talk\Nawful? You wanna go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.08,0:44:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Try dragging 200 pounds of stink\Nup a flight of stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.42,0:44:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,l barely got him in the bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.79,0:44:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bathtub, what...?\NWhat do you mean, bathtub?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.51,0:44:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,\Nand that's another thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.72,0:44:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you got me\Nrunning around town
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.26,0:45:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to find\Nsome stupid piece of plastic
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.76,0:45:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,when l have a perfectly good tub\Nl can use?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.73,0:45:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.98,0:45:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.98,0:45:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[DRlPPlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.41,0:45:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[HlSSlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.51,0:45:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.62,0:46:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm sorry, what were you\Nasking me? Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.33,0:46:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That stupid plastic container\Nl asked you to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.79,0:46:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, hydrofluoric acid\Nwon't eat through plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.59,0:46:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,lt will, however, dissolve\Nmetal, rock, glass, ceramic.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.30,0:46:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.64,0:46:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[GLEN PHlLLlPS' "THE HOLE"\NPLAYS]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.55,0:47:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,BOY:\NHere l go.
